OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,FSpeaking from Stourbridge in the West
OL,7,FMidlands, the prime minister said:
OL,8,F"Firstly, we have seen the military
OL,9,Fdeploy 100 personnel, initially to the
OL,10,Fmajor incident in south Wales, and
OL,11,Fwe're very grateful to our colleagues
OL,12,Fin the Ministry of Defence for that.
OL,13,FThat support is critically needed.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,F"We have a system of mutual aid in
OL,7,Fplay at the moment, where fire and
OL,8,Frescue services are supporting each
OL,9,Fother, but with so many incidents, it
OL,10,Fis crucial that the military support
OL,11,Fis there if fire and rescue services
OL,12,Fcan't do the same backup that they
OL,13,Fwould normally be doing. So that is
OL,14,Fhugely appreciated."
OL,16,FAndy Burnham has also announced a
OL,17,Ftemporary ban on disposable barbecues
OL,18,Fto help respond to the major incidents.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
