PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fpreviously declared a "major incident"
OL,8,Facross the region because of the
OL,9,Famount of blazes that have broken out.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, the service said it was
OL,11,Fat 30 wildfire incidents.
OL,13,FThe service said it submitted a
OL,14,Frequest for military aid "to provide
OL,15,Fadditional logistical and defensive
OL,16,Ftactical support" after "an extended
OL,17,Fperiod of hot weather and significant
OL,18,Foperational demand".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
