PN,43705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,FIn a statement the service added:
OL,7,F"Firefighters, control staff and
OL,8,Fsupport teams have been working around
OL,9,Fthe clock to protect communities,
OL,10,Fhomes, businesses, infrastructure and
OL,11,Fthe environment."
OL,13,FACFO at the service, Matt Jones, said:
OL,14,F"Our priority remains protecting
OL,15,Fcommunities while ensuring we can
OL,16,Fsustain our response to protect people
OL,17,Fin our communities for as long as
OL,18,Fconditions require.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
