OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,F"We have followed embedded escalation
OL,7,Fprocesses and have already activated
OL,8,Fmutual aid arrangements with National
OL,9,FResilience and other fire and rescue
OL,10,Fservices across the UK, and are using
OL,11,Fa wide range of resources to support
OL,12,Four response. Requesting military
OL,13,Fassistance is a sensible and
OL,14,Fprecautionary next step that provides
OL,15,Fadditional support capacity,
OL,16,Fstrengthens resilience and helps us
OL,17,Fcontinue to protect the communities we
OL,18,Fserve.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,F"This support will also help ensure
OL,7,Fthe welfare of firefighters and
OL,8,Fcolleagues who have been working in
OL,9,Fchallenging conditions over a
OL,10,Fprolonged period."
OL,12,FThe public is urged to continue
OL,13,Ffollowing safety advice, avoid
OL,14,Faffected areas and keep windows and
OL,15,Fdoors shut if affected by smoke.
OL,17,FIn a statement from the Welsh
OL,18,FGovernment, Elin Jones, Cabinet
OL,19,FMinister for Finance said:
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
