OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786915122
OL,3,CPrime minister deploys military to
OL,4,Ctackle major south Wales wildfires
OL,6,F"The Welsh Government has been
OL,7,Fsupporting South Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService in a formal MACA (Military Aid
OL,9,Fto the Civil Authorities) request to
OL,10,Fdeploy Army resources to assist them
OL,11,Fwith the current operations.
OL,13,F"This has now been agreed, and we are
OL,14,Fextremely grateful to the Army for
OL,15,Fproviding this additional support. The
OL,16,FWelsh Government stands ready to
OL,17,Fprovide funding for these military
OL,18,Fsupport operations should this be
OL,19,Frequired."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/8
